    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51092" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσομοιρ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη,</span>
		ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>equal share</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακοῖσιν ἐσθλοὺς ἰσομοιρίαν [ῑσ-]
					ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sol.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				12.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span> in a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.75
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσονομία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Nymphod.
				21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				52.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>equability</i>, of climate, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				12
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν κράσεων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					1.534
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> Astrol.,
				<i>equivalence of degree</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				139.16
			</span></i>.</div>
